  "title": "About the Library | KIU Library | KIU Library | Kampala International University",
  "text": "About the Library | KIU Library | KIU Library | Kampala International University Skip to content Kansanga, Kampala [email protected] My Library Account Ask a Librarian Home Discover Discover Find books, repository outputs and scholarly resources. Start with the catalogue, repository or resource directory, then ask a librarian when access or search strategy needs support. Explore Resources Catalogue Library Catalogue My Library Account Catalogue Help E-resources Subscribed Databases E-books E-journals Open Access Research Institutional Repository Literature Searching Referencing and Citation Publishing Support Libraries Main Library Postgraduate and Research Library Law Library Health Sciences Library Services Research Support Libraries About Staff Members Updates Contact Search Catalogue Back to About About KIU Library About the Library The Iddi Basajjabalaba Memorial Library supports learning, teaching and research across KIU. Learn about KIU Library The Iddi Basajjabalaba Memorial Library is the central library service of Kampala International University. It supports students, academic staff and researchers with print collections, electronic resources, reference support, study spaces and research guidance. The library website provides a practical gateway to the catalogue, institutional repository, electronic resources, research support services, library sections and support channels. Related pages Library History Vision and Mission Objectives Collections and Facilities KIU Library Supporting learning, teaching and research through catalogue services, repository access, electronic resources, information literacy and librarian guidance. Catalogue Ask a Librarian Discover Library Catalogue My Library Account Institutional Repository Electronic Resources Services Borrowing and Circulation Reference Services Information Literacy Remote Access Research Literature Searching Referencing and Citation Open Access KIU Publications Contact Kampala International Uni